{"id":"medianoche","lemma":"medianoche","pos":"noun","rank":1696,"glosses":["midnight","a small meat pie","a type of sandwich with spherical shaped roles and meats ranging from Sobrasada sausage, York ham or chorizo, containing cheese and even sometimes pieces of a Spanish omelette"],"ipa":"/medjaˈnot͡ʃe/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"medianoches"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-medianoche.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aún no es medianoche.","en":"It's not midnight yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788596"},{"text":"Tienes hasta la medianoche.","en":"You have until midnight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523293"},{"text":"Tiene hasta la medianoche.","en":"You have until midnight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523294"},{"text":"Tienen hasta la medianoche.","en":"You have until midnight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523295"},{"text":"Es casi medianoche aquí.","en":"It's almost midnight here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519338"}]}